  # ClassroomService.GetAssessment

  Online assessments (quiz and task items). Staff read the right answers and the roster; students their attempts

  `/ltedu.classroom.v1.ClassroomService/GetAssessment` · unary · `ltedu/classroom/v1/classroom.proto`

